  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "For the profit calculation, is the revenue per unit simply the \"Unit Price\" listed in the table (e.g., 1.25 yuan for Product I), with no additional costs beyond the raw material cost and the fixed machine operating costs?"
